@startuml
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram — AI Teacher Audio Session Initialization

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "Audio Lesson Screen" as Screen
participant "Stream Call Hook
(useStreamLessonCall)" as CallHook
participant "Session API Route
POST /api/stream/session" as SessionApi
participant "Supabase Auth" as SupabaseAuth
participant "Stream Server SDK" as StreamServer
participant "Stream Video Client" as VideoClient
participant "Agent Hook
(useStreamLessonAgent)" as AgentHook
participant "Agent API Route
POST /api/stream/agent" as AgentApi
database "Lesson Content
(Supabase)" as LessonDb
participant "Vision Agent Server" as AgentServer
participant "Lumi AI Teacher" as Teacher

Learner -> Screen: Open an audio lesson
Screen -> CallHook: Enable lesson call with session access token
CallHook -> SessionApi: POST lessonId, languageId, displayName
Authorization: Bearer accessToken
SessionApi -> SupabaseAuth: getUser(accessToken)

alt Access token is valid
  SupabaseAuth --> SessionApi: Authenticated learner
  SessionApi -> StreamServer: Upsert learner
  SessionApi -> StreamServer: Create or retrieve audio_room call
  SessionApi -> StreamServer: Generate time-limited user token
  StreamServer --> SessionApi: apiKey, userId, token, callType, callId
  SessionApi --> CallHook: Stream lesson session
  CallHook -> VideoClient: Connect learner using Stream token
  CallHook -> VideoClient: Get call(callType, callId)
  CallHook -> VideoClient: Join audio call
  VideoClient --> Screen: Calling state = joined

  Screen -> AgentHook: Enable AI teacher after call is joined
  AgentHook -> AgentApi: POST lessonId, callType, callId
Authorization: Bearer accessToken
  AgentApi -> SupabaseAuth: getUser(accessToken)
  SupabaseAuth --> AgentApi: Authenticated learner
  AgentApi -> LessonDb: Read lesson, language, goals,
vocabulary, and practice activities
  LessonDb --> AgentApi: Authoritative lesson payload
  AgentApi -> StreamServer: Upsert Lumi teacher user
  AgentApi -> StreamServer: Attach lesson payload to call
  AgentApi -> StreamServer: Add teacher as admin and grant audio permissions
  AgentApi -> StreamServer: Make call live when necessary
  AgentApi -> AgentServer: POST /calls/{callId}/sessions
  AgentServer -> Teacher: Start AI teacher session for the call
  Teacher --> AgentServer: sessionId
  AgentServer --> AgentApi: sessionId
  AgentApi --> AgentHook: sessionId, callId, agentUserId
  AgentHook --> Screen: AI teacher connected
  Teacher --> Learner: Join call and deliver live audio guidance
else Missing or invalid access token
  SupabaseAuth --> SessionApi: Unauthorized
  SessionApi --> CallHook: 401 error
  CallHook --> Screen: Connection error
  Screen --> Learner: Show retry feedback
end

== Session teardown ==
Learner -> Screen: Leave lesson
Screen -> AgentHook: Stop agent session
AgentHook -> AgentApi: DELETE callId, sessionId
Authorization: Bearer accessToken
AgentApi -> AgentServer: DELETE /calls/{callId}/sessions/{sessionId}
AgentServer --> AgentApi: Stopped or already absent
AgentApi --> AgentHook: Stopped
Screen -> CallHook: Leave call
CallHook -> VideoClient: Leave call and disconnect user
@enduml
